      "widgets_values": [
        "HearmemanAI | MOSS Image\n\n1. Edit the positive prompt and choose image size.\n2. Leave KROMOSS OFF for SFT, or switch ON for the 8-step model + DMD LoRA.\n3. Queue the workflow. Only the selected sampling branch executes.\n\nDefault: 1024 × 1024, batch 1. Width and height must be multiples of 16.\n\nBoth samplers use seed 1, fixed. Change the seed in the active sampler for a new variation.\n\nOutputs: HearmemanAI/MOSS\n\nRequires ComfyUI 0.42.1 or newer, which includes MOSS Image support and the built-in If/Else switch. These information panels are muted CLIPTextEncode nodes, not part of image generation.\n\nSpeed figures are supplied reference timings, not a hardware-independent guarantee. The negative prompt is not a safety filter or guarantee."
      ],
